name: "🐛 Bug report / 缺陷反馈"
description: Report a reproducible problem / 报告可复现的问题
title: "[Bug]: "
labels:
  - bug
body:
  - type: markdown
    attributes:
      value: |
        Thanks for reporting a bug. Usage questions and integration help belong in [GitHub Discussions](https://github.com/{{projectName}}/discussions).

        感谢反馈缺陷。使用问题和集成帮助请前往 [GitHub Discussions](https://github.com/{{projectName}}/discussions)。

  - type: checkboxes
    id: prerequisites
    attributes:
      label: Prerequisites / 提交前检查
      options:
        - label: I searched existing issues and discussions for the same problem. / 我已搜索现有 Issue 和 Discussions。
          required: true
        - label: I can reproduce the problem in a public minimal example without private data. / 我可以在不含私密数据的公开最小示例中复现问题。
          required: true

  - type: input
    id: package-version
    attributes:
      label: "{{projectName}} version / 版本"
      placeholder: e.g. 0.1.0
    validations:
      required: true

  - type: dropdown
    id: transport
    attributes:
      label: Transport / 传输方式
      options:
        - stdio
        - Streamable HTTP
        - Both / 两者都有
        - Other / 其他
    validations:
      required: true

  - type: input
    id: node-version
    attributes:
      label: Node.js version / Node.js 版本
      placeholder: e.g. 22.20.0
    validations:
      required: true

  - type: input
    id: mcp-client
    attributes:
      label: MCP client and version / MCP 客户端及版本
      placeholder: e.g. MCP Inspector 0.x, Claude Desktop, custom client
    validations:
      required: true

  - type: input
    id: operating-system
    attributes:
      label: Operating system and version / 操作系统及版本
      placeholder: e.g. macOS 26, Windows 11, Ubuntu 24.04
    validations:
      required: true

  - type: input
    id: minimal-reproduction
    attributes:
      label: Minimal reproduction URL / 最小复现地址
      description: Link a small public repository or example that reproduces the problem. / 请提供可复现问题的精简公开仓库或示例。
      placeholder: https://github.com/...
    validations:
      required: true

  - type: textarea
    id: steps
    attributes:
      label: Steps to reproduce / 复现步骤
      placeholder: |
        1. Clone or open the reproduction
        2. Run ...
        3. Observe ...
    validations:
      required: true

  - type: textarea
    id: expected-behavior
    attributes:
      label: Expected behavior / 预期行为
    validations:
      required: true

  - type: textarea
    id: actual-behavior
    attributes:
      label: Actual behavior / 实际行为
      description: Include complete errors, stderr output, or HTTP responses when relevant. Do not include secrets. / 如有错误、stderr 输出或 HTTP 响应，请完整粘贴并移除敏感信息。
      render: shell
    validations:
      required: true

  - type: textarea
    id: additional-context
    attributes:
      label: Additional context / 其他信息
      description: Add MCP configuration, command-line arguments, screenshots, or other details that may help diagnose the problem. Remove tokens and private data first. / 可补充 MCP 配置、命令行参数、截图或其他诊断信息，请先移除令牌和私密数据。
